Revision history for Deflate::Faster

0.03  2026-10-08
    - An out-of-range mod_time warns on perls with 32-bit integers too.
    - DESTROY of a foreign object blessed into Deflate::Faster no longer
      aborts a perl built with -DDEBUGGING.

0.02  2026-10-07
    - gunzip and unzip reject a gzip header with a wrong header checksum.
    - unzip clears file_name and mod_time in every format, and leaves them
      unset when it croaks.
    - copy_perl_flags finds its marker among other extra subfields and in
      any member.
    - file_name is written as Latin-1; characters beyond Latin-1 croak.
    - mod_time is clamped to 32 bits with a warning instead of wrapping.
    - gzip_file keeps the file name and mtime when other options are given.
    - DESTROY on a foreign blessed object no longer crashes.
    - Configure tries every libdeflate location and links pthread where
      needed.

0.01  2026-10-01
    - Initial release.
